{"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"module","modules":[{"name":"GnustoConversation"}],"title":"GnustoConversation","externalID":"GnustoConversation","role":"collection","roleHeading":"Framework"},"abstract":[{"text":"Adds ASK, TELL and SHOW, the per-actor tables that answer them, and a saved","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"record of what the player has worked out.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoConversation\/documentation\/GnustoConversation\/Conversation"],"title":"The layer","anchor":"The-layer"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoConversation\/documentation\/GnustoConversation\/Fact"],"title":"What the player knows","anchor":"What-the-player-knows"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoConversation\/documentation\/GnustoConversation\/topic(_:only:knowing:unless:learning:when:again:id:reply:)","doc:\/\/GnustoConversation\/documentation\/GnustoConversation\/topic(_:only:knowing:unless:learning:when:again:id:perform:)","doc:\/\/GnustoConversation\/documentation\/GnustoConversation\/TopicEntry","doc:\/\/GnustoConversation\/documentation\/GnustoConversation\/TopicBuilder"],"title":"Topic rows","anchor":"Topic-rows"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoConversation\/documentation\/GnustoConversation\/Conversations"],"title":"Articles","anchor":"Articles"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoConversation\/documentation\/GnustoConversation\/Gnusto"],"generated":true,"title":"Extended Modules","anchor":"Extended-Modules"}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The engine ships around fifty stub verbs so that no word a player tries in their","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"first five minutes comes back as ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"I don’t know the word","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":". ","type":"text"},{"code":"ask","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"tell","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"show","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" are deliberately not among them. A stub is a word with one line of stock","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"prose and no mechanic behind it, and there is no line that answers ","type":"text"},{"code":"ask the butler about the murder","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — the verb wants a topic slot, somebody to ask, and a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"table to look the subject up in. So the three words live here instead, with the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"table behind them, and ","type":"text"},{"code":"talk to","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and a bare ","type":"text"},{"code":"hello","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" come along with them.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"What the table is for is the shape a mystery needs and nothing in the engine","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"offered: an actor who says one thing until the player can prove otherwise, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"something else afterwards. A row can require a fact, be retired by one, teach","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"one, or test what is true of the world at the moment the player raises the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"subject. The facts are saved, so what a suspect says is a function of how much","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of the case has already been made against him.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoConversation\/documentation\/GnustoConversation\/Conversation","isActive":true},{"text":" is a ","type":"text"},{"code":"GameContent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" bundle rather than a ","type":"text"},{"code":"GamePlugin","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", because","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it owns state: the facts learned so far, and which rows each actor has already","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"given in full. Both are globals namespaced under the bundle, so save, restore","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and UNDO carry them with no work from the host. Everything else is the host’s —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the actors, the rows, and every word spoken, the five stock lines included,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which arrive through ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoConversation\/documentation\/GnustoConversation\/Conversation\/init(text:)","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import Gnusto","import GnustoConversation   \/\/ .product(name: \"GnustoConversation\", package: \"Gnusto\")","","struct Fulminate: Game {","    let talk = Conversation()","","    var content: GameContents { talk }        \/\/ the verbs, the facts, the heard set","","    var rules: Rules {","        talk.greeting(","            of: julian,","            again: \"\\\"Mm,\\\" he says, to the clamp.\",","            reply: \"\\\"You're early,\\\" he says to the bench. \\\"That's all right. Nothing's early enough.\\\"\")","","        talk.topics(","            of: julian,","            fallback: \"\\\"Later,\\\" he says, without turning round. \\\"You'll have all of it after six.\\\"\"","        ) {","            topic(","                \"delphine\", \"marsh\",","                reply: \"\"\"","                    \"Delphine keeps her own counsel.\" He tightens a clamp. \"It was the counsel I liked first.\"","                    \"\"\")","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoConversation\/documentation\/GnustoConversation\/Conversations","isActive":true},{"text":" is the full account: how a subject is matched, what gates a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"row, how an answer is made to land once, and a worked interrogation.","type":"text"}]}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GnustoConversation\/documentation\/GnustoConversation","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustoconversation"]}],"references":{"doc://GnustoConversation/documentation/GnustoConversation/TopicEntry":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"TopicEntry"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoconversation\/topicentry","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"One row of an actor’s topic table: what it answers to, what it needs, what","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it teaches, and what the actor says.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoConversation\/documentation\/GnustoConversation\/TopicEntry","title":"TopicEntry","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TopicEntry"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://GnustoConversation/documentation/GnustoConversation/Conversation":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"Conversation","abstract":[{"text":"A topic-driven conversation layer: per-actor tables of subjects the player","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"can raise, gated on and feeding a saved set of "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"facts","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" — what the player"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"has worked out so far.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Conversation","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Conversation"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoconversation\/conversation","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoConversation\/documentation\/GnustoConversati